Gingerbread Bars
  --Pennant

1 1/4 c sugar
1 c butter, softened
1 egg
3 tbsp molasses
3 c ap flour
1 tsp baking soda
2 tsp cinnamon
4 oz crystallized ginger coarsely chopped

Preheat oven to 350F. Combine sugar, butter, egg, and molasses in a arge mixing bowl. Beat at medium speed until creamy. Add flour, baking soda, cinnamon, and crystallized gingegr. Beat at low speed until well mized. Press dough into ungreased jelly roll pan 15x10x1". Bake 16-24 min or until lightly browned around the edges. Sprinkle with sugar and cut into bars.


